# Brand profile fragment — IIoT-Kit (reference profile).
#
# Selecting a profile is a Kconfig choice, so the fragment has to turn the
# other options of the choice off. The values themselves (name, model,
# colours, support URL, initial SSID, OTA channel) come from the brand
# Kconfig, which keeps a single source of truth for the public identity.
#
# Used by tools/brand/build-profile.sh.

# CONFIG_BRAND_PROFILE_IIOT_KIT is not set
CONFIG_BRAND_PROFILE_IIOT_KIT=y
